---
import ServiceLayout from '@/layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
import { services, formatFee } from '@/data/pricing.mjs';
const service = services.find(item => item.id === 'aica')!;
const faqs = [{"question": "Does AI CA include Voice AI?", "answer": "AI CA is listed as chat and SMS follow-up. Voice AI is a separately listed service. Confirm the channels and scope in your proposal."}, {"question": "Can AI CA guarantee booked or attended appointments?", "answer": "No. Outcomes depend on the inquiry, configuration, availability, and practice follow-up. Track confirmed bookings and attended visits separately."}, {"question": "Can I try it before a call?", "answer": "Yes. The homepage includes a public AI chat demonstration. A strategy call can cover your specific workflow and configuration."}];
---
<ServiceLayout title="AI CA™: Chat & SMS for Chiropractic Practices | ChiroCandy" description="AI CA™ supports practice questions, lead follow-up, and appointment scheduling through chat and SMS. It connects marketing inquiries with a next step while your practice remains responsible for patient care and staff follow-through." slug="ai-patient-coordinator" heroTitle="AI CA™: Chat & SMS for Chiropractic Practices" heroAnswer="AI CA™ supports practice questions, lead follow-up, and appointment scheduling through chat and SMS. It connects marketing inquiries with a next step while your practice remains responsible for patient care and staff follow-through." serviceName="AI CA™: Chat & SMS for Chiropractic Practices" dateModified="2026-10-09" faqs={faqs} relatedServices={[{href:'/services/voice-ai/',label:'Voice AI'},{href:'/services/reactivation-campaigns/',label:'Patient reactivation'},{href:'/services/google-advertising/',label:'Google Ads'}]}>
<h2>What does AI CA do?</h2><p>AI CA is ChiroCandy’s chat and SMS follow-up service. It helps respond to people who have contacted a practice, answer configured practice questions, and move interested leads toward an appointment. It can be part of a coordinated plan with <a href="/services/facebook-advertising/">Meta ads</a>, <a href="/services/google-advertising/">Google Ads</a>, and a <a href="/services/web-design/">practice website</a>.</p>
<h2>What should the practice prepare?</h2><ul><li>Accurate hours, services, location, and answers to common administrative questions.</li><li>A defined booking process, appointment availability, and rules for questions the assistant cannot answer.</li><li>A staff owner for callbacks, exceptions, and reviewing conversations.</li><li>Approved messaging, contact permissions, and the information that may be collected in the chosen workflow.</li></ul><p>Confirm the supported calendar, CRM connections, channels, and handoff behavior for your setup before launch. A booking request and a confirmed appointment need distinct statuses.</p>
<h2>See the chat experience</h2><p><a href="/#ai">Try the homepage AI demo</a> to explore an example conversation. It is a demonstration, not your practice’s configured assistant. Use fictional details and avoid sharing patient information. If you prefer a walkthrough, <a href="/schedule/">book a strategy call</a>.</p>
<h2>What happens when a person needs help?</h2><p>Define who receives unresolved questions and how soon the practice will respond. AI CA supports administrative follow-up; it does not replace clinical judgment or make the front desk unnecessary. Review sample conversations, unsuccessful booking attempts, and staff handoffs as part of setup.</p>
<h2>What results should you measure?</h2><p>Separate inquiries, reached contacts, booked appointments, attended visits, and acquired patients. Compare response times and the same stages over a defined period. A conversation is not proof of a new patient. Our <a href="/blog/chiropractic-advertising-leads-to-appointments/">lead-to-appointment guide</a> explains the handoff.</p><p>The <a href="/case-studies/advanced-care-chiropractic-jason-white/">Advanced Care Chiropractic case study</a> describes AI CA follow-up alongside paid campaigns and staff work. Its published numbers are ad-platform leads; they do not isolate AI CA’s effect or establish attendance.</p>
<h2>Do you also need phone support?</h2><p><a href="/services/voice-ai/">Voice AI</a> addresses telephone workflows. Chat/SMS and phone handling have different setup needs. Compare the channels and service fees before choosing one or both.</p>
<h2>What does it cost?</h2><p>The listed monthly service fee is <strong>{formatFee(service.fee)}</strong>. Applicable AI/SMS usage charges are additional. AI CA is also included with either published marketing package at no additional service fee; applicable usage charges remain separate. Review <a href="/pricing/">current packages, setup fees, and terms</a>, then confirm your scope in the agreement.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/schedule/">Discuss my practice’s workflow →</a></p>
</ServiceLayout>
